WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:06.640
Surrounded by Shi Lang's massive host, the defenders of Geyang had already held out for six grueling days.

00:06.720 --> 00:11.400
Here these inconspicuous places in the city can all have ambushes set if street fighting breaks out.

00:11.560 --> 00:13.560
Can greatly slow the enemy's advance.

00:15.000 --> 00:16.400
Report.

00:16.840 --> 00:20.840
The Wuzhao the Wuzhao have withdrawn withdrawn how is that possible?

00:20.960 --> 00:23.880
Absolutely true their army has already started moving.

00:25.320 --> 00:27.400
Let's go to see.

00:37.880 --> 00:43.880
Could it be our volunteers have come to help shilang thinks Yiyang is a tough nut to crack.

00:43.960 --> 00:45.960
And is preparing to attack elsewhere.

00:46.640 --> 00:48.000
No.

00:48.080 --> 00:53.680
More likely reinforcements have arrived shilang plans to besiege and attack reinforcements.

00:53.760 --> 00:58.280
The Wuzhao made no moves yesterday perhaps they were planning to turn their spears.

00:58.360 --> 01:02.000
To fully attack the reinforcements any news of reinforcements lately?

01:02.080 --> 01:05.080
The scouts we sent out none have returned.

01:07.480 --> 01:12.480
Your Highness the reinforcements are rushing likely can't maintain formation if they engage on the plains now.

01:12.640 --> 01:17.987
Rushing into battle with Wuzhao cavalry I'm afraid they won't survive two charges and will be completely routed.

01:20.000 --> 01:25.040
Your general requests to fight if we go out now and form with the reinforcements A pincer attack then we have a chance.

01:25.120 --> 01:26.680
What if reinforcements haven't come?

01:26.760 --> 01:29.093
Aren't you just delivering us to Shilang?

01:30.760 --> 01:35.680
The cooking fires in the Wuzhao camp haven't decreased if they really plan to leave.

01:35.760 --> 01:37.160
Why light fires?

01:38.040 --> 01:43.040
This is just a diversion should we wait for them to destroy the reinforcements then return to rest and attack the city?

01:43.200 --> 01:46.520
You please, Your Highness, decide.

